# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# A patch is applied byte by byte into another repository (mesa/mesa-switch-cod2.patch, with `git apply`),
# and its context lines have to match that repository's files exactly. Normalising its line endings on
# checkout breaks every hunk with "patch does not apply" - the target tree keeps LF and the patch arrives
# with CRLF. Patches are not text to be normalised; they are an artifact.
*.patch -text
*.diff -text
